{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 70,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.0628967285156,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "implement by keeping the same first line antibiotic recommendation for treatment of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        194.56285095214844,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "AOM and non-severe pneumonia.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        97.26070404052734,
        231.48292541503906,
        109.25070190429688
      ],
      "text": "8.2.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.91542053222656,
        326.8529357910156,
        126.4054183959961
      ],
      "text": "There were no placebo-controlled trials from developing countries.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        125.91542053222656,
        399.1015625,
        139.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "A Cochrane review (updated 2010) assessed 10 placebo controlled trials of oral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        138.91542053222656,
        399.0928039550781,
        152.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics conducted in developed countries with a total of 2928 children ranging",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.0229187011719,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "in age from infancy to 15 years [Sanders S, 2004]. Enrolment in the trials was based",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        399.11279296875,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "on clinical diagnosis, and primary outcomes included reported pain and health",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.12286376953125,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "professional-determined clinical cure. The antibiotics used were mostly beta-lactams,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        295.9093017578125,
        190.6953887939453,
        391.439208984375,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.17",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        399.1164855957031,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "although macrolides and sulphonamides were also studied ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.91539001464844,
        399.0628662109375,
        217.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "There is low-moderate quality evidence from the review for the equivalence of a range",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.91539001464844,
        396.7629089355469,
        230.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "of antibiotics, although the studies that were included were small, and the outcome-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.91539001464844,
        399.0728454589844,
        243.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "used, clinical response is likely to overestimate the effect of ineffective antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        249.63780212402344,
        242.6953887939453,
        346.3377380371094,
        256.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.18",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.91539001464844,
        351.5287170410156,
        256.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "because of a high rate of spontaneous recovery ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        255.91539001464844,
        399.1214904785156,
        269.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Combined results of the trials showed that pain was not reduced at 24 hours",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.9153747558594,
        399.04278564453125,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "from the start of treatment but it was reduced at 2 to 7 days, (RR 0.72; 95% CI 0.62",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.9153747558594,
        399.1528625488281,
        295.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "to 0.83). Compared with delayed treatment, immediate antibiotic treatment was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.9153747558594,
        399.0628356933594,
        308.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "associated with decreased ear pain at day four (RR 0.77; 95% CI 0.50 to 1.17). In",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.9153747558594,
        399.1230163574219,
        321.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "the four trials that measured tympanometry, there was no clinically or statistically",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.9153747558594,
        399.0827941894531,
        334.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "significant difference in tympanometry results at 1 or 3 months after the acute",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.9153747558594,
        399.0929260253906,
        347.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "episode, suggesting no effects on hearing. The review also found that antibiotics",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.9153747558594,
        399.12286376953125,
        360.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "appeared to reduce the development of contralateral otitis, although the difference",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.9153747558594,
        399.1028137207031,
        373.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "was not statistically significant. Individual patient data meta-analysis of a subset of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.9153747558594,
        399.14276123046875,
        386.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "the included trials found antibiotics to be most beneficial in children aged less than 2",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.9153747558594,
        256.1329345703125,
        399.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "years or those with bilateral AOM and otorrhoea.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        398.9153747558594,
        399.0814208984375,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "There are too few complications to be able to compare these across groups (eg. one",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.9153747558594,
        399.0727844238281,
        425.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "child out of 2928 children had mastoiditis). In applying these results to developing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        424.9154052734375,
        399.0630798339844,
        438.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "countries with a higher frequent risk of more serious complications like mastoiditis,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        437.9154052734375,
        247.47299194335938,
        451.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "antibiotic treatment would be strongly advised.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        450.9154052734375,
        399.0415954589844,
        464.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "A meta-analysis of 1643 children from six trials aged 6 months to 12 years looked",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        463.9154052734375,
        399.0729064941406,
        477.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "at the effect of antibiotics on an extended episode of AOM lasting 3–7 days [Rovers,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        476.9154052734375,
        399.0827331542969,
        490.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "2006]. Randomized placebo-controlled trials were included. Three of the six trials were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        489.9154052734375,
        399.062744140625,
        503.4054260253906
      ],
      "text": "included in the Cochrane review [Sanders S, 2004]. The relative risk of an extended",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        502.9154052734375,
        399.0829772949219,
        516.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "course of AOM at 3–7 days with antibiotics was 0.83 (95% CI 0.78–0.89), for fever was",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        515.9154052734375,
        399.0328674316406,
        529.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "0.95 (95% CI 0.92–98), and for pain was 0.86 (95% CI 0.81–0.91). A significant reduction",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        528.9154052734375,
        399.0428771972656,
        542.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "in pain, fever, or both was noted in the treatment arm for those less than 2 years of age",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        541.9154052734375,
        399.10296630859375,
        555.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "with bilateral disease (55% versus 30%; RD -25; 95% CI -36,-15) with a NNT of 4 and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.9154052734375,
        339.37286376953125,
        568.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "those with otorrhoea (60% versus 24%; RD -36; 95% CI -53,-19; NNT 3).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        567.9154052734375,
        399.111572265625,
        581.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "In another systematic review, short-term clinical success was higher for immediate",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        580.9154052734375,
        399.13275146484375,
        594.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "use of ampicillin or amoxicillin versus placebo respectively (73% versus 60%; pooled",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        593.9154052734375,
        399.1628723144531,
        607.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "rate difference, 12%; 95% CI 5%–18%; pooled rate difference, 12%; 95% CI 5%–18%];",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        606.9154052734375,
        203.97293090820312,
        620.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "NNT, 9, 95% CI, 6-20) [Coker, 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.39480590820312,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.64781188964844,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "56",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}